---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Aditya Vinod Kumar" description="Profile Page" canonicalPath="/" currentPage="home" bodyClass="home-page">
<div class="container hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <h1 class="display-2">Aditya VK</h1>
                <h4 class="hero-intro">You can call me Adi. Here is a look into what I do, think and feel. </h4>
                <SocialLinks />
            </div>
            <img class="profile-image" src="/assets/noir_profile.png" alt="profile picture" width="225" height="350">
        </div>
        <div class="container biography">
            <p>I currently work at <a href="https://www.rain.xyz/">Rain</a> in the Product and Engineering Team. We are building the infrastructure that lets anybody move money seamlessly in the future.</p>
            <p>I studied computer science at <a href="https://cims.nyu.edu/dynamic/">NYU Courant</a>. I’m optimistic about what we can build with technology, and especially excited by how AI, blockchain, and clean energy could reshape the way we live.</p>
            <p>My passion lies in solving population-scale problems, and care deeply about the trajectory of our society and civilization. I want to work to ensure that our species flourishes in an environment of abundance.</p>
            <p>I read widely, especially about our changing times through world affairs, foreign policy and current market trends. I am also fascinated by the unpredictability and non-determinism of the human mind.</p>
            <p>As a natural conversationalist, I love to talk, connect with people, hear everybody's stories and add more to their life. I seek out conversations where I can explore the ideas shaping our future.</p>
            <p>I’m constantly training to understand and push the limits of my body. Athleticism and Mobility are the foundations for the life I want to lead.</p>
            <h4 class="closing-thought">I am all about the Flow - any concluded sensible thought from start to end. </h4>
        </div>
</SiteLayout>
